<view class="page">
  <view class="page-title">设置</view>
  <view class="page-subtitle">管理 AI 服务地址、本地数据与隐私选项。</view>

  <view class="section-title">AI 后端</view>
  <view class="card">
    <view class="field">
      <text class="field-label">后端服务地址</text>
      <input
        class="input"
        value="{{backendUrl}}"
        placeholder="https://ai.example.com"
        bindinput="onUrlInput"
      />
    </view>
    <view class="hint">小程序只上传图片到你的后端，不保存模型 API Key。</view>
    <view class="current-url">当前地址：{{backendUrl || '未配置'}}</view>
    <view class="button-row">
      <button class="secondary-button" loading="{{testing}}" bindtap="testBackend">测试连接</button>
      <button class="primary-button" bindtap="saveBackend">保存地址</button>
    </view>
    <view class="status" wx:if="{{status}}">{{status}}</view>
  </view>

  <view class="section-title">本地数据</view>
  <view class="card data-card">
    <view class="data-row">
      <view>
        <view class="data-title">错题记录</view>
        <view class="muted">保存在当前微信小程序本地空间</view>
      </view>
      <view class="data-count">{{questionCount}} 道</view>
    </view>
    <view class="divider"></view>
    <button class="secondary-button" bindtap="exportData">复制 JSON 备份</button>
    <button class="danger-button clear-button" bindtap="clearData">清空所有错题</button>
  </view>

  <view class="section-title">隐私说明</view>
  <view class="card privacy">
    题目图片仅在你主动分析时发送到统一 AI 后端。模型密钥只配置在服务器环境变量中，
    不会进入小程序代码或本地存储。错题记录第一版仅保存在本机微信数据空间。
  </view>
</view>
